%% Two staff members move the same IP at once (apps/api/src/servers.ts, moveIp).
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor A as Staff A
  actor B as Staff B
  participant API
  participant DB as PostgreSQL

  A->>API: POST /api/ips/7/move, from S1 to S2
  B->>API: POST /api/ips/7/move, from S1 to S3
  API->>DB: tx A: SELECT ip 7 FOR UPDATE
  API->>DB: tx B: SELECT ip 7 FOR UPDATE (waits)
  API->>DB: tx A: the open assignment is on S1, as expected
  API->>DB: tx A: close it at app_now(), INSERT assignment for S2 from now
  Note over DB: trigger locks S2 FOR SHARE and checks it is alive, FK checks S2 and its customer
  API->>DB: tx A: COMMIT
  API-->>A: 200, moved
  DB-->>API: tx B gets the lock, the open assignment is now on S2
  API-->>B: 409 ip_not_on_source
  Note over DB: without the lock, the INSERT of B would overlap the one of A and the EXCLUDE constraint rejects it (23P01)
